:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Passout []
<<effects>>
<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The whole face of the <<beasttype>> is right in front of you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的面前是<<beasttype>>的整张脸。
  <</language>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> says something to you, but the words sound incomprehensible.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>对你说了些什么，但那些单词听起来令人费解。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> looks at you with curious, concerned eyes.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>用好奇和关切的眼神看着你。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHis>> wings begin to beat faster, and your stomach churns. When you open your eyes again, you see the hospital below and feathers at the edge of your vision.
      You blink, and in that instant you feel yourself suddenly begin to drop. Your feet touch the pavement. A powerful gust follows, and the <<beasttype>> is gone.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHis>>的翅膀开始更快地拍动，你感到胃里一阵翻腾。再次睁开眼睛时，你看到了下方的医院，以及视野边缘的羽毛。
      你一眨眼，那一瞬间你感觉自己突然开始降低。你的脚碰到了人行道。一股强烈的气流随之而来，<<beasttype>>消失了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<flight_hunt_end>><<HuntTogetherClean>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue", "继续"] "Pregnancy Birth Hospital Passout">>
    <<set $stress -= 5000>>
    <<endevent>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      When you open your eyes again, you are back at the tower. The <<beasttype>> and <<babyhawks>> are gathered around you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你再次睁开眼睛时，你已经回到了高塔。<<beasttype>>和<<babyhawks>>围在你身边。
  <</language>>
  <<set $stress -= 5000>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "<<Wife>>! What happened? I heard <<babyhawks>> crying out, and I saw you suddenly... drop. It was as if the sky had thrown you down."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "<<Wife>>！发生什么了？我听见<<babyhawks>>的叫声，看到你突然……掉了下去。就像是天空突然把你扔了下去一样。"
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> and <<babyhawks>> begin chirping urgently, clearly panicked.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>和<<babyhawks>>开始急切地喳喳叫，显得十分惊慌。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You reassure them that you are fine. <<babyhawks>> nuzzle their heads against you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你安慰了他们，表示你没事。<<babyhawks>>用脑袋蹭着你。
  <</language>>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Are you sure?" <<bhe>> is still very concerned.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你确定吗？"<<bhe>>依然十分关切。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe>> looks a little relieved, but still worried.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe>>看起来稍微安心了些，但还是很担忧。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<flight_hunt_end>><<HuntTogetherClean>>
  <br><br>
  <<lanLink ["Comfort them", "安慰他们"] "Bird Hunt Passout 2">>
    <<set $phase to 0>>
    <<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <<gdom>>
  <br>
  <<lanLink ["Ignore them", "无视他们"] "Bird Hunt Passout 2">>
    <<set $phase to 1>>
    <<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom -1>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <<ldom>>
  <br>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Return Ask []
<<effects>><<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You tell your <<babyhawks>> that you want to return to the castle.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你告诉你的<<babyhawks>>，你想回城堡了。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $BirdTower.ring.hint is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname $orphanHawkChildId>> screeches happily in reply, <<childhis>> talons still clutching <<childhis>> ring.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname $orphanHawkChildId>>高兴地尖鸣回应你，<<childhis>>的爪里还抓着<<childhis>>的戒指。
  <</language>>
<<elseif $bird.hunts.lootAmount is 0>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname>> screeches loudly in complaint; it seems <<childhim>> still wants to keep hunting. Regardless, you set off on the way home.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname>>大声尖鸣抱怨，看起来<<childhim>>还想继续狩猎。无论如何，你们踏上返程。
    <</language>>
    <<set $childRecords[$BirdTower.hunt.leader].development.activity to "hunting">>
    <<set $childRecords[$BirdTower.hunt.leader].development.timer to 30>>
    <!-- 这里没法做单独处理，就不情愿地回家再自己出去狩猎吧！ -->
  <<elseif maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname>> gives a small grumble; with empty talons, <<childhim>> still wants to keep hunting. You set off on the way home.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname>>发出小小的抱怨声，<<childhim>>两爪空空，还想继续狩猎。你们踏上返程。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Empty-taloned, <<babyhawksthem>> answer your call with frustration. You set off on the way home.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        两爪空空，<<babyhawksthem>>回应你的叫声里带上了沮丧。你们踏上返程。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif $bird.hunts.timer lte 30>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawksthem>> chirp and twitter, unwilling to head back so soon. You set off on the way home with the grumbling <<babyhawks>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawksthem>>唧唧喳喳地叫着，不想这么快就回去。你带着不断抱怨的<<babyhawks>>踏上了返程。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawksthem>> screech in reply, and you set off on the way home.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawksthem>>尖鸣着回应你，你们踏上返程。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<lanLink ["Continue", "继续"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Return">>
  <<endevent>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Plane Chase []
<<effects>><<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You fly behind your child; <<childname>> is
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你飞在你的孩子身后，<<childname>>正
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        taking the lead up front,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        在最前方领头，
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      chasing the plane as fast as possible.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      尽可能快地追着飞机。
  <</language>>
  <<if currentSkillValue('athletics') gte 600>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You keep close behind <<babyhawksthem>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你紧紧跟着<<babyhawksthem>>。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The speed of <<babyhawksthem>> shocks you, and you struggle to keep up with <<childname>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<babyhawksthem>>的速度令你震惊，你努力跟上<<childname>>。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Together you chase the plane for several minutes, until it finally flies out of sight.
      <br><br>
      <<childname>> cries out in disappointment, but still looks determined. You doubt this will be <<childhim>> last attempt at catching a plane.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们一起追了飞机好几分钟，直到它最终飞出视野。
      <br><br>
      <<childname>>失望地叫着，但看起来仍然坚定。你怀疑这不会是<<childhim>>最后一次尝试抓飞机。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You fly behind your children; <<babyhawks>> are chasing the plane as fast as they can.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你飞在你的孩子身后，<<babyhawks>>正尽可能快地追着飞机。
  <</language>>
  <<if currentSkillValue('athletics') gte 400>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You keep close behind <<babyhawksthem>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你紧紧跟着<<babyhawksthem>>。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You struggle to keep up with <<babyhawksthem>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你努力跟上<<babyhawksthem>>。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Together you chase the plane for several minutes, until <<babyhawks>> stop, panting, and watch it finally fly out of sight. <<babyhawksthem>> cry out to the sky in disappointment.
      <br><br>
      You take <<babyhawks>> to rest on a nearby tree trunk for a while.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们一起追了飞机几分钟，直到<<babyhawks>>气喘吁吁地停下，看着它最终飞出了视野。<<babyhawksthem>>冲着天空失望地叫着。
      <br><br>
      你带着<<babyhawks>>到附近的树干上歇息了一会儿。
  <</language>>
  <<tiredness -6>>
  <br><br>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Ignore []
<<effects>><<flight_distance_check>>
<<if $bird.hunts.goal is "babyhawk">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tell <<babyhawks>> to ignore it, then look away.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你告诉<<babyhawks>>无视它，然后看向了别处。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if ["clever", "dominant"].includes(maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait)>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> screeches in response.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>尖鸣着回应。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<babyhawks>> screech in response.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<babyhawks>>尖鸣着回应。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You decide to ignore it and look away.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们决定无视它，然后看向别处。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_options>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Exit []
<<effects>>
<<set _huntFail to 1>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
